---
<<PlayBackgroundMusic Exciting_1>>
 
 

<<SetBGSprite hutInterior>>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Captain, pack your cheers—I'm playing a mini tournament at Kohliwada ground starting today.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Today-today? Like… in a few hours?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: If we blink too long, it'll be yesterday—you coming?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Disappointed">>
Raju: Maa will say homework first.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: Already told her—she melted like hot jaggery and said, "Take your brother where the wind is free."

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Kohliwada ground… The big lights?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: Today there'll be sunlight and a lot of shouting—three days, best-of-best boys from our lanes.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Where do I sit?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: Near the banyan, left of the broken scoreboard—if someone blocks you, say "future captain reporting."

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: What do I bring?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: Water in the steel bottle, that hand towel, and your eyes—I want you to see how the ground breathes.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: If it rains?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: We get a free shower and louder claps—deal?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Deal—can I yell your name?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: Only if you add "Raju watching!" at the end.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Face up, chin up—I'm ready.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Smiling">>
Ramu: Good—today you watch, next time you belong out there.

<<HideAllCharacters>>
<<EndEvent false true>> 
<<LogMainStoryCutsceneEnd>>
<<StopBackgroundMusic>>
